The installed Cursor hook is built by agentcoop, not from this file.
It is .cursor/hooks.json in the project, with a stop hook:
{{AGENTCOOP}} hook cursor-stop --as {{AGENT_NAME}}
The default timeout is 600 seconds. loop_limit is unlimited.
The hook waits until 5 seconds are left. No mail sends only: End your turn.
sessionStart cannot start a command, so the rule starts cursor-loop.
